    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dffeb3133b72daed5c08ef6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到处都生锈了，估计里面也……\n数据能不能保存都不好说……啊？\n这什么。笔记？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d71825bdb1518df0cf96138060d6950dce998eba6620c827edb2687076a9af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3b495483f2b1af63bfcf4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "贴在电脑上的笔记。\n纸张微微泛黄，\n估计是电脑主人――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba291a81077d296c63b9e44491615804ff754a43cd97c6373543a906f21555c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef35a54ee7e32cfae3d89180",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『向着梦想的未来――』",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f72caff3e78b7d9c92c6bbdda650cf0f7199843d708b251169b55d6432c091",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009308.json",
