      "uid": "zhcn:ae6b8950e1976e8ef306a4c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一点也不期待。\n再说了，如果他真是『传说』，\n功绩什么的肯定早就被记录下来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d13a5f0f8485f4d360b06e735027fdbebc88f6a4099ac71f9c490d1037d70f50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
